<title>USA: Northwest Airlines to offer Detroit-Reno service.</title>
<headline>Northwest Airlines to offer Detroit-Reno service.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Northwest Airlines Corp said Monday it will begin daily non-stop service between Detroit and Reno, Nev., effective January 31.</p>
<p>The carrier originally announced it would offer non-stop service between the two cities on Saturdays beginning December 21.  The schedule is being expanded to include daily service because of strong customer response, Northwest said.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
